  .140E Z for A = 0

@1410 PATH_RAW_NAME
  Part of PATH_PARSE, IX+6 bit 3: the rest of the text, case kept, is one raw 11-character name
  up to a "/" or the end, padded with spaces; characters past 11 are skipped.
